# lilgrip.com — Cursor Rules (Astro 7 + Bun)

You are working on **the lilgriper** site: Astro 7 static site on GitHub Pages at `lilgrip.com`.

## Stack (non-negotiable)

- **Runtime / package manager:** Bun (`bun install`, `bun run …`). Do not switch to npm/yarn/pnpm for this repo.
- **Framework:** Astro 7, TypeScript, static output (`output: "static"`).
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 via `@tailwindcss/vite`; design tokens in `src/styles/global.css` (`@theme`).
- **Interactivity:** React islands in `src/components/islands/` only where client state or Supabase I/O is needed. Marketing pages stay mostly `.astro`.
- **Do not** add Next, Remix, Vue, SvelteKit, or a separate SPA router for static routes.
- **Do not** add Bootstrap, Bulma, or a second CSS framework alongside Tailwind.

## Migration boundary

- **Source of truth for new work:** `src/`, `public/`, `astro.config.mjs`.
- Do not reintroduce a parallel vanilla root `index.html` / `styles.css` / `script.js` site.

## File layout

| Area | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/pages/*.astro` | One file per route |
| `src/layouts/` | Shared document shell |
| `src/components/` | Astro UI (header, hero, cards, footer) |
| `src/components/islands/*.tsx` | Client React (notes, sightings); start file with one-line purpose comment |
| `src/lib/` | Supabase client + all data helpers — **only** place for Supabase I/O |
| `src/styles/global.css` | Global styles + theme tokens |
| `public/` | `CNAME`, favicon, images (copied to `dist/` as-is) |

- Path alias: `@/*` → `src/*` (e.g. `@/lib/notes`, `@/components/Hero.astro`).
- Prefer splitting files that exceed ~200 lines by responsibility.
- Keep `README.md`, `OVERVIEW.md`, `TODO.md`, and `AGENTS.md` accurate when architecture changes.

## Visual / brand

- **Theme:** Cooler Catppuccin — **sky and blue** as primary accents (`--color-sky`, `--color-blue` in `@theme`).
- **Not** pink-primary brand face; peach/mauve/teal are supporting warmth, not candy-pink hero accent.
- **No** terminal / hacker / localhost-console chrome, fake shell prompts, or dense dashboard clutter unless the user explicitly asks.
- Chill tone: whitespace, soft motion; respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Hero scripture: 1 Corinthians 16:14 (WEB): “Let all that you do be done in love.”

## Supabase / data

- Env (client-safe only): `PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY` — see `.env.example`.
- **Never** commit `.env` or use service-role keys in the browser.
- Tables: `lilgrip_comments`, `grip_sightings`; bucket: `grip-sightings` (anon select/insert as designed).
- Sanitize/clamp user text in `src/lib/` before insert; cap upload size/MIME for sightings.
- Document schema or RLS changes in `OVERVIEW.md`.

## Code quality

- Run `bun run lint`, `bun run check`, `bun run test` before claiming done; `bun run build` for deploy-related changes.
- Biome for format/lint; `astro check` for types; Vitest for pure helpers; Playwright for smoke when e2e exists.
- Conventional commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `chore:`).

## Deploy awareness

- GitHub Pages serves **`dist/`** from CI on `main` (when workflow is wired).
- Domain: `lilgrip.com` via `public/CNAME`; `site` in `astro.config.mjs` must stay `https://lilgrip.com`.

## When unsure

- Read `AGENTS.md` first, then `OVERVIEW.md`.
- Match existing patterns in `src/lib/` and island components before inventing new data layers.
- Update `TODO.md` when finishing or discovering follow-up work.
